<title>POLAND: BANK KOMUNALNY 96 NET RISES TO PLN 8 MLN.</title>
<headline>BANK KOMUNALNY 96 NET RISES TO PLN 8 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results December</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit					  0.45 vs    0.96</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    0.91 vs    2.29</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		  1.65 vs    5.23</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	 3.36 vs    2.17</p>
<p>JANUARY-DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit					  8.00 vs    6.52</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   11.54 vs    9.61</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 16.81 vs   16.49</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	34.81 vs   20.72</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Komunalny SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
